{"id":"B2-L014","title":"Past Perfect Continuous — production and review","cefr":"B2","level":"B2","unit":"B2-U01","focus":"Past Perfect Continuous — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Past Perfect Continuous — produção e revisão","pron":"Flap T americano","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":["A blessing in disguise"],"words":["cancelled train","station announcement","stranger’s offer","chance meeting","platform bench","departure board","rainy evening","furious face","kind stranger","life twist","train ticket","station café","travel delay","fate’s hand","station shop","trip cancellation","cancelled ticket","departure hall","night train","trip preparation"],"field":"Sociedade","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escuta","words_min":20},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 14 · Past Perfect Continuous — production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Past Perfect Continuous — produção e revisão.","**Expressões:** A blessing in disguise.","**Pronúncia:** Flap T americano.","**20 palavras novas** (sociedade).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B2):** eu consigo escrever uma cena de conto com Past Perfect Continuous e usar A blessing in disguise."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["cancelled train","trem cancelado"],["station announcement","anúncio da estação"],["stranger’s offer","oferta de um estranho"],["chance meeting","encontro casual"],["platform bench","banco da plataforma"],["departure board","painel de partidas"],["rainy evening","noite chuvosa"],["furious face","rosto furioso"],["kind stranger","estranho gentil"],["life twist","reviravolta de vida"],["train ticket","bilhete de trem"],["station café","café da estação"],["travel delay","atraso de viagem"],["fate’s hand","mão do destino"],["station shop","loja da estação"],["trip cancellation","cancelamento de viagem"],["cancelled ticket","bilhete cancelado"],["departure hall","salão de embarque"],["night train","trem noturno"],["trip preparation","preparação da viagem"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Missed Train","paras":["Marta **had been waiting** at the station for an hour when the announcement came: her train was cancelled. She **had been planning** this trip for months. Furious, she **had been about to** cry when a stranger offered her a ride.","They talked for hours. Years later they married. The missed train was **a blessing in disguise**."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"Original story","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Marta had been waiting for an hour.","ans":"T","why":"an hour."},{"q":"The stranger refused to help.","ans":"F","why":"offered a ride."},{"q":"The missed train turned out well.","ans":"T","why":"a blessing in disguise."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“blessing in disguise” = ?","opts":["mal que vem para o bem","bênção disfarçada só","bênção em casa"],"ans":0,"why":"blessing in disguise."},{"q":"“stranger” = ?","opts":["estranho","estrangeiro","estrada"],"ans":0,"why":"stranger."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Past Perfect Continuous em narrativa","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Para…","Exemplo"],"rows":[["cenário anterior","**She had been waiting for an hour.**"],["evento","**The announcement came.**"],["explicar emoção","**She was furious: she had been planning it for months.**"],["sequência","**Then / Years later**"]],"cap":"Past Perfect Continuous em narrativa"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Em contos, o Past Perfect Continuous cria **profundidade temporal**: o que vinha acontecendo antes da cena principal."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Marta had been ___ for an hour. (wait -ing)","a":"waiting","why":"-ing."},{"s":"She had been ___ the trip for months. (plan -ing)","a":"planning","why":"-ing."},{"s":"A stranger ___ her a ride. (offer, past)","a":"offered","why":"Past Simple."},{"s":"It was a blessing in ___ . (disguise)","a":"disguise","why":"expressão."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["train station","estação de trem"],["cancelled train","trem cancelado"],["station announcement","anúncio da estação"],["long wait","longa espera"],["stranger’s offer","oferta de um estranho"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["you","a","ride","I","can","give"],"ans":"I can give you a ride","pt":"Posso lhe dar uma carona."},{"words":["been","waiting","long","Had","you"],"ans":"Had you been waiting long","pt":"Esperava há muito?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"cancelled train","pos":"word","pt":"trem cancelado","ex":"Cancelled train.","expt":"Trem cancelado."},{"w":"station announcement","pos":"word","pt":"anúncio da estação","ex":"Station announcement.","expt":"Anúncio da estação."},{"w":"stranger’s offer","pos":"word","pt":"oferta de um estranho","ex":"Stranger’s offer.","expt":"Oferta de um estranho."},{"w":"chance meeting","pos":"word","pt":"encontro casual","ex":"Chance meeting.","expt":"Encontro casual."},{"w":"platform bench","pos":"word","pt":"banco da plataforma","ex":"Platform bench.","expt":"Banco da plataforma."},{"w":"departure board","pos":"word","pt":"painel de partidas","ex":"Departure board.","expt":"Painel de partidas."},{"w":"rainy evening","pos":"word","pt":"noite chuvosa","ex":"Rainy evening.","expt":"Noite chuvosa."},{"w":"furious face","pos":"word","pt":"rosto furios